WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.280
Hi, I'm Thursday,
with Joe Deal

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.840
at No Big Deal
Home Solutions.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.800
Ever wonder what a roofer
actually does up there?

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.933
Here's the whole visit.

00:00:08.933 --> 00:00:10.613
Joe comes out himself.

00:00:10.613 --> 00:00:14.933
He walks the roof: shingles,
flashing, vents, gutters.

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:17.893
He takes photos,
so you see what he sees.

00:00:17.893 --> 00:00:19.600
Then he tells you straight.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.333
Fix it, watch it,
or leave it alone.

00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:24.023
It's free. No pressure.

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:25.878
And when you call?

00:00:25.878 --> 00:00:27.948
Joe answers his own phone.

00:00:27.948 --> 00:00:32.058
Book yours at
nobigdealwithjoedeal.com/inspect.
